      "id": "ieee-ral-submission",
      "slug": "ieee-ral-submission",
      "articleTitle": "RAL 投稿经验",
      "articleContent": "# RAL 投稿经验\n\n## 0. 模板下载\n\n### 匿名模板\n\n1. 进入 IEEE [官方网站](https://ieeeauthorcenter.ieee.org/)。\n\n![IEEE 作者中心](/legacy-assets/Tools%20%26%20Tech/paper_writing/images/RAL/4.png)\n\n### 终稿模板\n\n1. 进入 IEEE [作者中心](https://ieeeauthorcenter.ieee.org/)，点击 AUTHOR TOOLS（作者工具）。\n\n![作者工具入口](/legacy-assets/Tools%20%26%20Tech/paper_writing/images/RAL/1.png)\n\n2. 进入 Author Tools - IEEE Author Center New Authors，点击 IEEE Template Selector 选择模板。\n\n![模板选择器](/legacy-assets/Tools%20%26%20Tech/paper_writing/images/RAL/2.png)\n\n3. 依次选择 Transactions, Journals and Letters，输入期刊名称 IEEE Robotics and Automation Letters，选择文章类型和写作格式，最后点击下载。\n\n![RAL 模板选项](/legacy-assets/Tools%20%26%20Tech/paper_writing/images/RAL/3.png)\n",
      "articleCover": "/legacy-assets/assets/images/background2.png",
      "summary": "IEEE Robotics and Automation Letters 模板下载、写作与投稿准备。",
      "createTime": "2026-07-22T00:00:00",
